WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.083
- I look like Helga

00:00:01.083 --> 00:00:02.013
from Hey Arnold!
(bell chiming)

00:00:02.013 --> 00:00:04.259
(whooshing, sign squeaking)

00:00:04.259 --> 00:00:06.800
- Today we're gonna be
trying the squiggle brow.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.414
- I have heard of the squiggle brow.

00:00:08.414 --> 00:00:10.337
I've also heard of the squiggle lip.

00:00:10.337 --> 00:00:12.549
People just really like
squiggly things right now.

00:00:12.549 --> 00:00:14.180
- No one's actually doing this for real.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.199
Like you're not stepping out
into the world like this.

00:00:16.199 --> 00:00:17.615
- I can't even be mad at it.

00:00:17.615 --> 00:00:18.962
It's a well-made brow.

00:00:18.962 --> 00:00:21.262
- [Kayleigh] It's like an ocean
over the top of your eyes.

00:00:21.262 --> 00:00:22.415
- I do fill in my brows.

00:00:22.415 --> 00:00:25.383
- I generally just don't
do make up in general.

00:00:25.383 --> 00:00:27.321
- It's better than the
feather brow, for sure.

00:00:27.321 --> 00:00:29.178
- I only want a squiggle at the end.

00:00:29.178 --> 00:00:30.236
And I think what I'm gonna do is

00:00:30.236 --> 00:00:32.484
just like dip into my natural brow

00:00:32.484 --> 00:00:34.969
and start the squiggle process.

00:00:34.969 --> 00:00:37.592
- So in terms of confidence
right now I'm at a solid four.

00:00:37.592 --> 00:00:41.163
- Can I just cover my
entire brow with concealer?

00:00:41.163 --> 00:00:43.535
- Squiggle with it,
squiggle with it, okay.

00:00:43.535 --> 00:00:46.727
- The eye pencil I'm
using is called Corrupt,

00:00:46.727 --> 00:00:49.131
and I am corrupting my face right now.

00:00:49.131 --> 00:00:50.908
- I'm drawing my squiggle.

00:00:50.908 --> 00:00:52.649
If I'm going big, I'm going ho--

00:00:52.649 --> 00:00:54.768
Wait, that's not how the saying goes.

00:00:54.768 --> 00:00:56.486
- Don't do concealer first.

00:00:56.486 --> 00:00:58.314
I think I have more like zig-zag.

00:00:58.314 --> 00:01:01.024
- Maybe that's gonna be
the new trend after this.

00:01:01.024 --> 00:01:02.291
The zig-zag brow.

00:01:02.291 --> 00:01:07.019
- This squiggle is about to be
off the motherfucking chain.

00:01:07.019 --> 00:01:09.001
- Do you think people are
gonna react positively?

00:01:09.001 --> 00:01:09.905
- They're gonna send me home.

00:01:09.905 --> 00:01:11.361
- For looking too good.

00:01:11.361 --> 00:01:13.053
It looks like I have little toupees

00:01:13.053 --> 00:01:15.092
floating over my eyes right now.

00:01:15.092 --> 00:01:19.168
- Art defined, pow.

00:01:19.168 --> 00:01:20.460
(laughing)

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:23.458
(camera clicking)

00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:26.223
- I think it's time for us
to show these looks off.

00:01:26.223 --> 00:01:27.829
- Um, you know, interesting.

00:01:27.829 --> 00:01:30.189
- Yeah, it's better than what
I've seen on the internet.

00:01:30.189 --> 00:01:31.022
- Thanks.
- Oh, okay.

00:01:31.022 --> 00:01:32.926
- Thank you so much.
- Look at you from the sides.

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:35.755
I don't know, you just look
really upset about something.

00:01:35.755 --> 00:01:38.055
- I'm worried why you're
covering your face,

00:01:38.055 --> 00:01:41.479
so I'll start over here.
- This one's just thick.

00:01:41.479 --> 00:01:44.448
- I would pass on the said squiggle brow.

00:01:44.448 --> 00:01:46.612
- But yours, they don't look too bad.

00:01:46.612 --> 00:01:47.529
- Thank you.

00:01:47.529 --> 00:01:49.880
- Yours looks more like the Joker.

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:51.471
- He's a popular character.

00:01:51.471 --> 00:01:53.375
I fit into pop culture now.

00:01:53.375 --> 00:01:55.186
- It looks a little different.

00:01:55.186 --> 00:01:56.807
- Looks like something went wrong.

00:01:56.807 --> 00:01:58.338
- I'm one-brow Dee today.

00:01:58.338 --> 00:02:00.283
- I still don't see a squiggle.

00:02:00.283 --> 00:02:02.801
- We're walking down the
streets of New York City.

00:02:02.801 --> 00:02:04.451
- I would have to say thumbs down.

00:02:04.451 --> 00:02:05.868
- It's different.

00:02:07.510 --> 00:02:09.631
- [Anita] Different good, different bad?

00:02:09.631 --> 00:02:10.464
- Just different.

00:02:10.464 --> 00:02:12.675
- You wanna do some crazy
shit with your eyebrows,

00:02:12.675 --> 00:02:13.967
you should come to New York.

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:16.377
- Like does anyone see a squiggle here?

00:02:16.377 --> 00:02:18.193
- No.
(laughing)

00:02:18.193 --> 00:02:20.747
- I'd say the reactions have been

00:02:20.747 --> 00:02:22.806
more positive for Sasha.

00:02:22.806 --> 00:02:25.440
- I learned that you shouldn't
use a gray eyeliner pencil

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:26.799
to fill in your eyebrows.

00:02:26.799 --> 00:02:29.084
- No one's gonna insult us
to our faces, I don't think.

00:02:29.084 --> 00:02:30.922
- Let's roll the camera back.

00:02:30.922 --> 00:02:33.301
- Looks like you're going to the circus.

00:02:33.301 --> 00:02:36.242
- From the responses that
we've gotten around the office,

00:02:36.242 --> 00:02:37.695
I low-key look cute.

00:02:37.695 --> 00:02:41.308
- I would do the squiggle brow
for maybe Halloween, a rave.

00:02:41.308 --> 00:02:44.309
- I give the squiggle brow a
thumbs up if you do it right.

00:02:44.309 --> 00:02:47.031
- The thing to learn here is subtlety.

00:02:47.031 --> 00:02:49.012
My look, a little over the top.

00:02:49.012 --> 00:02:50.511
- So I'm all for the idea.

00:02:50.511 --> 00:02:53.053
Great idea, horrible execution.

00:02:53.053 --> 00:02:57.045
- Squiggle brow, like up in the
club with the LED eyelashes.

00:02:57.045 --> 00:02:58.805
- What clubs are you going to?

00:02:58.805 --> 00:03:02.252
- I'm not a professional,
but I wanted to try it

00:03:02.252 --> 00:03:03.685
to show the other people out there

00:03:03.685 --> 00:03:06.829
who don't do their own makeup
that they also shouldn't do it

00:03:06.829 --> 00:03:09.193
and that they should
have somebody with them

00:03:09.193 --> 00:03:11.397
who knows how to do their brows help them.

00:03:11.397 --> 00:03:14.694
You'll get better results,
as opposed to this.

00:03:14.694 --> 00:03:17.108
(rock music)

00:03:17.108 --> 00:03:20.775
(sign whooshing, squeaking)

